requirement = SubResource("Resource_tf2pc")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_kio1v")
markedup_result_text = "The scribes work through the night, recording all the verses composed by the settlement's poets.

Each poem is copied down, line by line, stroke by stroke.

The poets and scribes alike are exhausted, but the records remain."

